# An unterminated block comment points at where it starts.
mode: syntax
---- query
t | take 1 /* note
| where x > 1
---- expected
IDENT@0..1 "t"
WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
PIPE@2..3 "|"
WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
IDENT@4..8 "take"
WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
LONG@9..10 "1"
WHITESPACE@10..11 " "
BLOCK_COMMENT@11..33 "/* note\n| where x > 1\n"

error[DS0006]: unterminated block comment
  --> query:1:12
  |
1 | t | take 1 /* note
  |            ^^ this comment is never closed
  |
  = help: close it with `*/`
  = note: block comments do not nest
